{"code":"313760","name":"캐리","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"전기제품","sector_desc":"2차전지 셀·전선·전기 부품 등. 전기차와 에너지저장장치(ESS) 수요가 주요 동력입니다.","desc":"동사는 2003년 전력변환장치 제조 및 판매를 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2019년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 2024년 신재생에너지 사업부문을 물적분할하여 종속기업 윌링스를 설립하였으나, 2025년 제3자 유상증자로 인한 지분율 감소로 윌링스는 관계기업으로 변경되었음. 동사는 전력전자 산업을 영위하며, 유도가열 인버터, 선박수처리용 장치, 직수정수기 제어장치, 통신용 배터리팩 등 다양한 전력변환장치를 개발, 제조 및 판매하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":468.0,"open":468.0,"high":468.0,"low":468.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-75.8389,"ma20":468.0,"ma60":468.0,"ma120":468.0,"ma200":647.93,"close_vs_ma200":-27.77,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-80.2047,"r2_250":0.7378,"high52":2140.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":21.8692,"dd_52w":-78.1308,"mdd_1y":-76.7337,"atr14_pct":35.7143,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":36.4526,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":6.27,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.01,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-5.0,"op_margin_q":null,"op_qoq":28.5714,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":54.5455,"rev_yoy":-100.0,"op_trend_4q":28.5714,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-31.34,"debt_ratio":165.78,"per":null,"pbr":0.27,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":6.27,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"313760","name":"캐리","market":"KOSDAQ","